  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Middle East Humanitarian Appeal - Phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GAZA: ACF in Gaza focuses on providing life-saving assistance to all IDPs in Gaza; the proposed intervention aims to increase access to clean and affordable drinking and domestic water to 50,000 individuals. This services will be provided through water trucking. LEBANON: The proposed intervention aims to support 290 internally displaced households (1450 individuals) currently residing outside of designated emergency shelters to access their basic food and non-food needs via one-off emergency cash assistance as per the Basic Assistance sector recommendation.</narrative>
  </description>
